  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 5988409344
    m_Localized: For your knowing i see you through that litte sweet camera.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 235358117888
    m_Localized: So dont pick in your noses or burp cause you are on the job. Very
      serious job!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 237304274944
    m_Localized: And burbs or yawns will be seen as a negative behaviour.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 238977802240
    m_Localized: "We are the goverment for damn sake. We must represesnt some level
      of \r\nprofessionalism."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1137376747520
    m_Localized: You all will solve your first case today. I hope you are excited!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296152125440
    m_Localized: 'One at a time i help you so dont worry. But only this once. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1507255640064
    m_Localized: But remember im jugemental man. So try to not irrate me with your
      stupidy if you may.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1760914563072
    m_Localized: If you succed in irrating me. Well you propably will lose job. And
      then god knows where central comitty will put you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1919350202368
    m_Localized: 'Okay you the one looking like lost child. I dont like face what
      you think better than this? '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2174959476736
    m_Localized: 'Nobody cares focus up! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
